	(text "Regulation: HV is divided by R16/R17/R21/R22 (4 x 10M) + R23 (301k), compared with VREF (3.0 V) by U7 (hysteresis R18/R19), which gates RESET of the 555 (setpoint ~402 V). D14 (39 V zener) only protects Vb."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160 145 0)
		(effects
